_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910524020:1":{"text":"내 전음 능력으로 온 힘을 다해 이 선율을 멀리 전해 보겠네.","source_cn":"我会用传音天赋，尽最大力量将乐声传递出去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DE1FA117CC5CADC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910524021:1":{"text":"우리 선율에 맞추기만 하면 되니 긴장하지 말렴, 얘들아.","source_cn":"放轻松，孩子们，合着我们的旋律就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE139151D09BDB06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910524022:1":{"text":"말랑아, 기운을 내야지?","source_cn":"小浪花，打起精神来，好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A4C80709CC10E52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910524023:1":{"text":"음...","source_cn":"嗯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB634A48A76C25FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1910524024:1":{"text":"파도 장로에게 우리의 목소리가 닿을 수 있도록, 해류의 가호가 함께하기를.","source_cn":"愿洋流保佑，令波涛长者能够听到我们的声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98151FDC2BB314F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","docu